  "description": "PITTUJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H85 Ho3 N8 Ni2 O16 2+,5(C1 H4 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.219-3.853 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.45-113.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni2Ho3(LH)3(LH2)]Cl2·5CH3OH.",
